(\description (TEXT "Invalid inline link destinations fall back to shortcuts"))
(\details (TEXT "A bare destination with an interior space") (\link (TEXT "a")) (TEXT "(x\\ y) is not an inline link, so the") (\link (TEXT "a")) (TEXT "resolves as a shortcut and the (x\\ y) stays literal, as do the multi-space") (\link (TEXT "b")) (TEXT "(p q r) and the still-spaced") (\link (TEXT "c")) (TEXT "(url ok) forms. A valid destination keeps its link:") (\href (VERB "x%20y") (TEXT "d")) (TEXT "percent-encodes,") (\href (VERB "x y") (TEXT "e")) (TEXT "uses angle brackets, and") (\href (VERB "url") (TEXT "f")) (TEXT "carries a title."))
(\title (TEXT "Invalid inline link destinations fall back to shortcuts"))
